  "repair": [
    "The native executor supplies exact nonprotected field prefix, total UTF-8 and UTF-16 lengths, selection and explicit truncation to Fara, Holo and GUI-Owl with the matching current or historical editor caption.",
    "Projection is limited to 512 UTF-8 bytes without splitting a Character. The full verification snapshot remains local. Secure, disabled, missing, changed or invalid fields cannot produce a value projection; action ownership is checked again after reading.",
    "Native Tab remains literal. Provider descriptions explain that a multiline editor may insert a tab and tell models to inspect the resulting focus/text observation.",
    "Fara now retains the original captured native outcome after intermediate history eviction. Every adapter rejects orphaned native text, mixed browser/native context and oversized serialized state/history.",
    "The test-only actual-model workflow now accepts a prompt and independent expected field values; neither expected state nor fixture coordinates are added to model input. The new two-field Unicode case is a failing regression sentinel."
  ],
